00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://parsa-abbasi.github.io/post/cqd-shap-arxiv-update/</guid><description>&lt;p>We updated our preprint &lt;a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.15623" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&lt;em>CQD-SHAP: Explainable Complex Query Answering via Shapley Values&lt;/em>&lt;/a> on &lt;a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.15623" target="_blank" rel="noopener">arXiv&lt;/a>. The updated codebase to reproduce our experiments is also available on &lt;a href="https://github.com/ds-jrg/CQD-SHAP" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub&lt;/a>.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>CQD-SHAP accepted at ECML PKDD 2026</title><link>https://parsa-abbasi.github.io/post/cqd-shap-accepted/</link><pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://parsa-abbasi.github.io/post/cqd-shap-accepted/</guid><description>&lt;p>Our paper, &lt;a href="https://parsa-abbasi.github.io/publication/cqd-shap/">&lt;em>CQD-SHAP: Explainable Complex Query Answering via Shapley Values&lt;/em>&lt;/a>, has been accepted at &lt;a href="https://ecmlpkdd.org/2026/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ECML PKDD 2026&lt;/a> in Naples, Italy. Joint work with &lt;a href="https://www.uni-paderborn.de/person/11871" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Dr. Stefan Heindorf&lt;/a>.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>I will present the work on September 9 at 12:05 in the session &lt;em>&amp;ldquo;Structured Graphs, Causal &amp;amp; Relational Learning.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em> The poster session will take place the same day, from 7 to 9 PM.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Projects</title><link>https://parsa-abbasi.github.io/projects/</link><pubDate>Sun, 19 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://parsa-abbasi.github.io/projects/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Experience</title><link>https://parsa-abbasi.github.io/experience/</link><pubDate>Tue, 24 Oct 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://parsa-abbasi.github.io/experience/</guid><description/></item><item><title>DeepSentiPers: Novel Deep Learning Models Trained Over Proposed Augmented Persian Sentiment Corpus</title><link>https://parsa-abbasi.github.io/publication/deepsentipers/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://parsa-abbasi.github.io/publication/deepsentipers/</guid><description/></item></channel></rss>